  "_rotationComment": "Every match is different: each land's own table is always used (its weights jittered by tableJitter), plus rotationPicks species drawn from that land's rotation pool for that match, picked by weight without repeats (so the 1.2-weight starters and pseudo-legendaries are drawn into a match less often than the 4-weight regulars) and never one already in the land's table. megaLines: every Pokémon line that can Mega Evolve has at least one of its first form placed in its land each match, so its Mega Stone is always usable.",
  "tableJitter": [
    0.6,
    1.4
  ],
